file caravan/suffice.rye one of thirty-one rungs whose twenty-seven-line body became a three-line stub
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling ratcheted 75205 to 74485
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish carry pins moved to the measurement, fold queue prose repointed to ask_path
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish repointed from the folded family to the new measured head
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_prose_count_scan.sh a percent-sigilled row reads as a name rather than a count
file tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish both directions of the sigil rule proven on a generated control
file crux/REDS.md REDS %131 booked and closed, headline moved to the measured spine
recommend keep-going ask_path at thirty-one rungs by twenty-five lines -- 660 by realized fall, zero widening, the fourth member of the reader-box shape and the head the meter names. Behind it apprise_the_raiser at 658 over fifteen rungs and redress_the_meeting at 645 over sixteen, both zero, both short ladders carrying long bodies. Then weigh_the_answer 624, confirm_pruned 516, seat_note 504 opening three. The ones that truly cost: choose_pass 630 opening 129, may_pass 574 opening 96, load_one 549 opening 120, read_own_line 492 opening 126. mend_the_plan is spent at 72 -- a seventeen-line stub against a nineteen-line body.
